  "ruleText": "Env-Wr 204.02 Appeals. Appeals of department decisions under RSA 482 shall be directed to the water council in accordance with RSA 21-O:14 and Ec-Wtr 200.\n\nSource. #1644, eff 10-7-80; ss by #2207, eff 12-13-82; ss by #2900, eff 11-7-84; ss by #5080, eff 2-22-91; ss and moved by #6462-B, eff 2-21-97 (from Env-Wr 205.02); ss by #8285, INTERIM, eff 2-21-05, EXPIRES: 8-20-05; ss by #8413, eff 8-20-05; ss by #10509, eff 1-22-14; ss by #13979, eff 5-24-24 (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Wr 100)",
